== Trivia ==
* The item is a reference to microtransactions, which are common in modern video games. They serve the "pay-to-win" goal by making it either impossible or extremely tedious for players to either progress through the game (with so-called "roadblocks") or earn certain features such as weapons unless they purchase their "way out."

